    "closed_domain": false,
    "positive_streamwise_flow": false,
    "curved_boundary": false,
    "non_ideal_mesh_quality": false,
    "notes": "Inspired by Breuer, Bernsdorf, Zeiser & Durst (2000), Accurate computations of the laminar flow past a square cylinder. https://doi.org/10.1016/S0142-727X(99)00081-8 . Re uses maximum inlet velocity; blockage D/H=1/8. Starter domain: 5D upstream and 24D downstream of the square, not asserted identical to the publication. The pressure/backflow outlet is an approximation. Compare drag, lift and shedding frequency only after checking domain, boundary, mesh and time-step equivalence. Forces in 2D are per unit depth. No published-result validation has been run."
  },
